WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.856 --> 00:00:07.560
Open "Story" on the drawing screen.

2
00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:15.519
Say or type what the room looks like.

3
00:00:16.019 --> 00:00:21.723
Tap "Analyse": you see the steps in plain words.

4
00:00:22.223 --> 00:00:30.120
Remove what is wrong and tap "Carry out steps".

5
00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:36.335
One tap of "Undo" puts everything back.

6
00:00:36.785 --> 00:00:41.633
In this video the AI's reply is simulated.

